{"4084590": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "bonitāka's aquarium of medusae", "steam_appid": 4084590, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Help a marine biologist gather anomalous jellyfish for her supernaturally-hauntingly-odd research project!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084590/extras/65c1bb3e91bfeaec5ca483bb5c48b941.webp?t=1787917214\" width=600 height=44 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084590/extras/0cbf26c7c045524f36537bb7e0179e1d.poster.avif?t=1787917214\" width=780 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084590/extras/0cbf26c7c045524f36537bb7e0179e1d.webm?t=1787917214\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084590/extras/0cbf26c7c045524f36537bb7e0179e1d.mp4?t=1787917214\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Peer into six different unique jellyfishes' observations, musings on life and the world. Each jellyfish was voiced by a friend of mine in a language of theirs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084590/extras/1b5d8b252dd6d27fcecb14c4e74fcae6.webp?t=1787917214\" width=600 height=44 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084590/extras/4f39b1691be380b5f94055118d29b0ae.poster.avif?t=1787917214\" width=780 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084590/extras/4f39b1691be380b5f94055118d29b0ae.webm?t=1787917214\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084590/extras/4f39b1691be380b5f94055118d29b0ae.mp4?t=1787917214\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each jellyfish species you collect by submarine or fishing is added to the aquarium, which you can then zone out to and watch while listening to music composed by my best friend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084590/extras/fd7b1a9165ded41ff4264490934c482f.webp?t=1787917214\" width=600 height=44 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084590/extras/68f52e1954d0dabb5fb35cfd590b5d8c.poster.avif?t=1787917214\" width=780 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084590/extras/68f52e1954d0dabb5fb35cfd590b5d8c.webm?t=1787917214\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084590/extras/68f52e1954d0dabb5fb35cfd590b5d8c.mp4?t=1787917214\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intended to be played through in a single sitting, this game is a gift to myself for having made 22 years around the sun. I wanted to make a short celebration of the little things in life, bonds, and struggles. It's a game I wanted to make for myself and a story that I wanted to tell myself. If this kind of experience speaks to you, I hope you enjoy it...</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Help a marine biologist gather anomalous jellyfish for her supernaturally-hauntingly-odd research project!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084590/extras/65c1bb3e91bfeaec5ca483bb5c48b941.webp?t=1787917214\" width=600 height=44 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084590/extras/0cbf26c7c045524f36537bb7e0179e1d.poster.avif?t=1787917214\" width=780 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084590/extras/0cbf26c7c045524f36537bb7e0179e1d.webm?t=1787917214\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084590/extras/0cbf26c7c045524f36537bb7e0179e1d.mp4?t=1787917214\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Peer into six different unique jellyfishes' observations, musings on life and the world. Each jellyfish was voiced by a friend of mine in a language of theirs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084590/extras/1b5d8b252dd6d27fcecb14c4e74fcae6.webp?t=1787917214\" width=600 height=44 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084590/extras/4f39b1691be380b5f94055118d29b0ae.poster.avif?t=1787917214\" width=780 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shar